{"seq":3,"slug":"langchain-tools","title":"LangChain 工具系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-tools","wordCount":1083,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"langchain-工具系统\">LangChain 工具系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工具（Tool）是 Agent 与外部世界交互的接口。在 LangChain 中，工具将外部能力（搜索引擎、数据库、API、文件系统等）封装为 LLM 可理解、可调用的标准化组件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工具如何被选中\">工具如何被选中</h3><ul>\n<li>LLM 通过工具的名称和描述来决定何时以及如何调用它们</li>\n<li>工具的描述质量直接决定了 Agent 的行为准确性</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[LLM 推理]--&gt;B{Tool Router}&#10;    B--&gt;C[搜索工具]&#10;    B--&gt;D[数据库工具]&#10;    B--&gt;E[API 工具]&#10;    B--&gt;F[自定义工具]&#10;    C--&gt;G[返回结果]&#10;    D--&gt;G&#10;    E--&gt;G&#10;    F--&gt;G&#10;    G--&gt;A\">flowchart TD\n    A[LLM 推理]--&gt;B{Tool Router}\n    B--&gt;C[搜索工具]\n    B--&gt;D[数据库工具]\n    B--&gt;E[API 工具]\n    B--&gt;F[自定义工具]\n    C--&gt;G[返回结果]\n    D--&gt;G\n    E--&gt;G\n    F--&gt;G\n    G--&gt;A</pre><h3 id=\"内置工具类型\">内置工具类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具类型</th>\n<th>输入格式</th>\n<th>典型用例</th>\n<th>内置支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>搜索工具</td>\n<td>自然语言查询</td>\n<td>Web 搜索、知识检索</td>\n<td>Tavily, SerpAPI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库工具</td>\n<td>SQL/查询语法</td>\n<td>数据查询、统计分析</td>\n<td>SQL Database</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 工具</td>\n<td>结构化参数</td>\n<td>第三方服务调用</td>\n<td>RequestsTool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件工具</td>\n<td>文件路径/内容</td>\n<td>读写文件、代码分析</td>\n<td>FileSystem</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算工具</td>\n<td>数学表达式</td>\n<td>精确计算、数值分析</td>\n<td>Calculator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码执行</td>\n<td>代码片段</td>\n<td>动态计算、数据处理</td>\n<td>PythonREPL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自定义工具开发\">自定义工具开发</h2><h3 id=\"三种创建方式\">三种创建方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tool</code> 装饰器/函数</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单的单输入工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DynamicStructuredTool</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要复杂结构化输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>继承 <code>StructuredTool</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要最大灵活性与状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"tool-函数-简单场景\">tool 函数：简单场景</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const weatherTool = tool(async (input: string) =&gt; `${input} 当前温度 25°C，晴天`, {&#10;  name: &#39;get_weather&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;获取指定城市的天气信息&#39;,&#10;  schema: z.object({ city: z.string().describe(&#39;城市名称&#39;) }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> weatherTool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 当前温度 25°C，晴天`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'get_weather'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'获取指定城市的天气信息'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ city: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'城市名称'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dynamicstructuredtool-复杂输入\">DynamicStructuredTool：复杂输入</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const databaseQuery = new DynamicStructuredTool({&#10;  name: &#39;query_database&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;执行 SQL 查询&#39;,&#10;  schema: z.object({&#10;    query: z.string(),&#10;    limit: z.number().optional(),&#10;  }),&#10;  func: runSelectOnly,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> databaseQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DynamicStructuredTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'query_database'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'执行 SQL 查询'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limit: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  func: runSelectOnly,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>func</code> 中先校验仅允许 SELECT，再返回 JSON 序列化的查询结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"继承-structuredtool-最大灵活性\">继承 StructuredTool：最大灵活性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class GitHubTool extends StructuredTool {&#10;  name = &#39;github_search&#39;;&#10;  description = &#39;搜索 GitHub 仓库，返回仓库名、星数和描述&#39;;&#10;  schema = z.object({&#10;    query: z.string(),&#10;    language: z.string().optional(),&#10;  });&#10;  async _call({ query, language }) {&#10;    /* 调用 GitHub Search API，返回前 5 个仓库 */&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GitHubTool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StructuredTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'github_search'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '搜索 GitHub 仓库，返回仓库名、星数和描述'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    language: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 调用 GitHub Search API，返回前 5 个仓库 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"描述编写要点\">描述编写要点</h3><p>工具描述的编写是一门艺术，模糊的描述会导致 LLM 在错误的时机调用工具。描述应清晰说明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>这个工具做什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入要求</td>\n<td>接受什么参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出格式</td>\n<td>返回什么内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具组合与路由\">工具组合与路由</h2><ul>\n<li>复杂的 Agent 通常拥有多个工具</li>\n<li>需要设计合理的路由策略来确保 LLM 选择正确的工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"toolkit-模式-按领域分组\">Toolkit 模式：按领域分组</h3><ul>\n<li>每个实体生成 <code>list_*</code>、<code>get_*</code>、<code>create_*</code> 三个工具</li>\n<li>按领域批量装配成工具包</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const createCRUDToolkit = (entity: string) =&gt; [listTool(entity), getTool(entity), createTool(entity)];&#10;const allTools = [...createCRUDToolkit(&#39;product&#39;), ...createCRUDToolkit(&#39;order&#39;)];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCRUDToolkit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entity), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entity), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entity)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allTools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCRUDToolkit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCRUDToolkit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工具数量的最佳实践\">工具数量的最佳实践</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具数量</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt;5</td>\n<td>限制 Agent 能力</td>\n<td>补充关键领域工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5–15</td>\n<td>选择准确性与成本的平衡区间</td>\n<td>推荐范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;15</td>\n<td>选择难度与 Token 消耗上升</td>\n<td>分层路由：先选类别再选工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具安全与验证\">工具安全与验证</h2><ul>\n<li>工具是 Agent 与外部系统的边界，安全性至关重要</li>\n<li>必须在工具层面实现输入验证、权限控制和操作审计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安全数据库工具示例\">安全数据库工具示例</h3><p>校验逻辑分三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>校验内容</th>\n<th>拒绝示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>仅放行 SELECT 语句</td>\n<td>任何写操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>拦截危险关键字（DROP/DELETE/UPDATE/INSERT/ALTER）</td>\n<td>拼接的危险子句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>核对表名白名单</td>\n<td>访问未授权的表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"func: async ({ query }) =&gt; {&#10;  const q = normalize(query);&#10;  if (!isSelect(q)) {&#10;    return &#39;安全拒绝：仅 SELECT&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  if (hasForbidden(q)) {&#10;    return &#39;安全拒绝：危险关键字&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  if (!tableAllowed(q)) {&#10;    return &#39;安全拒绝：表不在白名单&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  return runQuery(q);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSelect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '安全拒绝：仅 SELECT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasForbidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '安全拒绝：危险关键字'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tableAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '安全拒绝：表不在白名单'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"六类安全策略\">六类安全策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全策略</th>\n<th>实现层面</th>\n<th>防护目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入验证</td>\n<td>Zod Schema</td>\n<td>防止注入、格式错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白名单机制</td>\n<td>工具配置</td>\n<td>限制可访问资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作审计</td>\n<td>回调/中间件</td>\n<td>记录所有工具调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>工具包装器</td>\n<td>防止过度调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工确认</td>\n<td>Agent 中断</td>\n<td>高危操作二次确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果脱敏</td>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>防止敏感数据泄露</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具测试与调试\">工具测试与调试</h2><p>工具的可靠性直接决定了 Agent 的整体表现，系统的测试策略应覆盖两个维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[工具测试]--&gt;B[功能正确性]&#10;    A--&gt;C[选择正确性]&#10;    B--&gt;D[直接调用工具断言]&#10;    C--&gt;E[跑 Agent 验证选中]\">flowchart TD\n    A[工具测试]--&gt;B[功能正确性]\n    A--&gt;C[选择正确性]\n    B--&gt;D[直接调用工具断言]\n    C--&gt;E[跑 Agent 验证选中]</pre><h3 id=\"维度一-工具功能正确性\">维度一：工具功能正确性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const testToolDirectly = async (tool: DynamicStructuredTool, input: object, expected: string) =&gt; {&#10;  const result = await tool.invoke(input);&#10;  return result.includes(expected);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testToolDirectly</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DynamicStructuredTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expected);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"维度二-llm-工具选择正确性\">维度二：LLM 工具选择正确性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const testToolSelection = async (agent, userQuery: string, expectedTool: string) =&gt; {&#10;  const result = await agent.invoke({ messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: userQuery }] });&#10;  return (result.intermediateSteps || []).some((s) =&gt; s.action?.tool === expectedTool);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testToolSelection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expectedTool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: userQuery }] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.intermediateSteps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.action?.tool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expectedTool);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"langsmith-追踪调试\">LangSmith 追踪调试</h3><p>调试工具调用时，LangSmith 的追踪功能是最有价值的手段，它能展示每一步的完整推理过程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追踪信息</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工具选择</td>\n<td>为什么选择了某个工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用参数</td>\n<td>传入了什么参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回结果</td>\n<td>得到了什么结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>工具是 Agent 连接外部世界的桥梁，工具描述的质量直接影响 Agent 的行为准确性</li>\n<li>三种创建方式适用于不同复杂度：<code>tool</code> 函数、<code>DynamicStructuredTool</code>、<code>StructuredTool</code> 类</li>\n<li>工具数量建议控制在 5-15 个，超过时应采用分层路由策略</li>\n<li>安全设计是生产工具的必备要素，需要在输入验证、权限控制和审计三个层面综合防护</li>\n<li>工具测试需要覆盖两个维度：工具自身的功能正确性和 LLM 对工具的选择正确性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LangChain 工具系统","id":"langchain-工具系统"},{"level":2,